msgid "Carolers Court's open! Mrs Alder's already in it, singing flat."
msgstr "颂歌庭院开放啦！奥尔德太太已经在里面了，唱得还是跑调。"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/journey.lua
msgid "Evergreen Hill's open! You can see the whole line from up here!"
msgstr "常青山丘开放啦！站在这里，整条小路尽收眼底！"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/journey.lua
msgid "Gingerbread Green's open! It doesn't smell of gingerbread yet. Give it a week."
msgstr "姜饼草坪开放啦！这儿还没有姜饼味，过一星期再来闻闻。"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/journey.lua
msgid "Lantern Lane's clear! There's a lamp post that still works if you kick it."
msgstr "灯笼巷清理好了！有一盏路灯，踢一脚还能亮。"

#: games/christmas-market/lua/journey.lua
msgid "Starlight Terrace is open! You can hear the Fenwick choir from up here. Nearly in tune."
msgstr "星光露台开放啦！站在这里能听见芬威克合唱团的歌声，差不多在调上。"

